{"slug":"hh-z-n","ar":"ح ز ن","total":42,"core":"grief","forms":[{"ar":"يَحْزُن","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":37,"gloss":"to grieve","word":null,"ex":{"s":43,"a":68,"p":8,"ar":["يَـٰعِبَادِ","لَا","خَوْفٌ","عَلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْيَوْمَ","وَلَآ","أَنتُمْ","تَحْزَنُونَ"],"en":"[To whom Allah will say], \"O My servants, no fear will there be concerning you this Day, nor will you grieve"}},{"ar":"حَزَن","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"grief, sorrow","word":null,"ex":{"s":35,"a":34,"p":7,"ar":["وَقَالُوا۟","ٱلْحَمْدُ","لِلَّهِ","ٱلَّذِىٓ","أَذْهَبَ","عَنَّا","ٱلْحَزَنَ ۖ","إِنَّ","رَبَّنَا","لَغَفُورٌ","شَكُورٌ"],"en":"And they will say, \"Praise to Allah, who has removed from us [all] sorrow. Indeed, our Lord is Forgiving and Appreciative"}},{"ar":"حُزْن","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"grief, sorrow","word":null,"ex":{"s":12,"a":84,"p":10,"ar":["وَتَوَلَّىٰ","عَنْهُمْ","وَقَالَ","يَـٰٓأَسَفَىٰ","عَلَىٰ","يُوسُفَ","وَٱبْيَضَّتْ","عَيْنَاهُ","مِنَ","ٱلْحُزْنِ","فَهُوَ","كَظِيمٌ"],"en":"And he turned away from them and said, \"Oh, my sorrow over Joseph,\" and his eyes became white from grief, for he was [of that] a suppressor"}}],"surahs":[[2,6],[3,4],[12,3],[28,3],[5,2],[6,2],[7,2],[9,2],[10,2],[15,1],[16,1],[19,1],[20,1],[21,1],[27,1],[29,1],[31,1],[33,1],[35,1],[36,1],[39,1],[41,1],[43,1],[46,1],[58,1]]}